# Only deliberate application inputs enter images.
*
!Dockerfile
!requirements.txt
!pyproject.toml
!server/
!server/**
!scripts/
!scripts/**
# Local state must never override application configuration in an image.
**/__pycache__/
**/*.py[cod]
**/.env
**/.env.*
**/*.db
**/*.sqlite
**/*.sqlite3
**/.playwright-mcp/
